error[SE0320]: node `Both` has both code and a `structure` block
   --> tests/emit/lib/checks/Checks.se:105:6
    |
105 | node Both {
    |      ^^^^ leaf or composite, never both
    = note: a composite just groups and aggregates: its state is the union of its descendants' and it leaves no runtime trace at all (§6.1, §15.2)
    = help: move the code into a child leaf node

error[SE0415]: `(deg)` may not be a declared unit
   --> tests/emit/lib/checks/Checks.se:115:32
    |
115 |     settings { heading: double(deg) = 90.0; }
    |                                ^^^ declare this in radians
    = note: units are erased in bodies (§4.4), so `sin(state.theta)` on a degree-valued accessor is silently wrong, and no dimensional system can catch it
    = help: declare the radian unit and convert at the literal — `theta (rad): double = 90 (deg);`

error[SE0345]: `next()` in a node with no `discrete` states
  --> tests/emit/lib/checks/Checks.se:67:5
